      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 27,
      "source_quote": "恪已自封侯，故弟融襲爵。攝兵業駐公安，部曲吏士親附之。",
      "reading": "兄恪已有侯爵，弟融繼承父爵與公安兵眾。卷六十四恪致弟書題稱公安督融。",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete:line080:reading-027-129",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete:line080",
      "person_id": "lpo_z63_vzb_B",
      "related_person_ids": [],
      "start_codepoint": 27,
      "end_codepoint": 129,
      "source_quote": "疆外無事，秋冬則射獵講武，春夏則延賓高會，休吏假卒，或不遠千里而造焉。每會輒歷問賓客，各言其能，乃合榻促席，量敵選對，或有博弈，或有摴蒱，投壺弓彈，部別類分，於是甘果繼進，清酒徐行，融周流觀覽，終日不倦。",
      "reading": "四季講武、設宴與賓客的遊藝。",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete:line080:reading-129-157",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete:line080",
      "person_id": "lpo_z63_vzb_B",
      "related_person_ids": [
        "lpo_z63_vzb",
        "512_1cd_a4b"
      ],
      "start_codepoint": 129,
      "end_codepoint": 157,
      "source_quote": "融父兄質素，雖在軍旅，身無采飾；而融錦罽文繡，獨爲奢綺。",
      "reading": "「父兄」分指父諸葛瑾與兄諸葛恪。",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete:line080:reading-157-188",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete:line080",
      "person_id": "lpo_z63_vzb_B",
      "related_person_ids": [
        "572_278_cba",
        "512_1cd_a4b"
      ],
      "start_codepoint": 157,
      "end_codepoint": 188,
      "source_quote": "孫權薨，徙奮威將軍。後恪征淮南，假融節，令引軍入沔，以擊西兵。",
      "reading": "孫權死後融徙奮威將軍。恪征淮南，融受節進沔。",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete:line080:reading-188-213",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete:line080",
      "person_id": "lpo_z63_vzb_B",
      "related_person_ids": [
        "512_1cd_a4b",
        "672_8ty_yoe",
        "cfb_d3e_1b8",
        "wpk_253_fu9",
        "aa5_798_24b"
      ],
      "start_codepoint": 188,
      "end_codepoint": 213,
      "source_quote": "恪既誅，遺無難督施寬就將軍施績、孫壹、全熙等取融。",
      "reading": "恪誅後，無難督施寬會同將軍施績、孫壹、全熙取融。卷五十一孫奐傳則由壹追述此役。",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete:line080:reading-213-246",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete:line080",
      "person_id": "lpo_z63_vzb_B",
      "related_person_ids": [],
      "start_codepoint": 213,
      "end_codepoint": 246,
      "source_quote": "融卒聞兵士至，惶懼猶豫，不能決計，兵到圍城，飲藥而死，三子皆伏誅。",
      "reading": "正文作飲藥而死，三子伏誅而均未具名。",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete:line080-pei01-01:reading-000-051",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete:line080-pei01-01",
      "person_id": "lpo_z63_vzb_B",
      "related_person_ids": [],
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 51,
      "source_quote": "吴书曰：融字叔长，生於宠贵，少而骄乐，学为章句，博而不精，性宽容，多技艺，数以巾褐奉朝请，后拜骑都尉。",
      "reading": "裴注所引《吳書》字叔長及少時技藝、騎都尉。",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete"
    },
    {
