      ],
      "start_codepoint": 51,
      "end_codepoint": 91,
      "source_quote": "赤乌中，诸郡出部伍，新都都尉陈表、吴郡都尉顾承各率所领人会佃毗陵，男女各数万口。",
      "reading": "吳書分稱新都都尉陳表與吳郡都尉顧承。",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete:line080-pei01-01:reading-091-108",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete:line080-pei01-01",
      "person_id": "lpo_z63_vzb_B",
      "related_person_ids": [
