      ],
      "start_codepoint": 91,
      "end_codepoint": 108,
      "source_quote": "表病死，权以融代表，后代父瑾领摄。",
      "reading": "表死後孫權先以融代陳表，繼而融代父瑾領攝。",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete:line080-pei02-01:reading-000-045",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete:line080-pei02-01",
      "person_id": "lpo_z63_vzb_B",
      "related_person_ids": [],
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 45,
      "source_quote": "江表传曰：先是，公安有灵鼍鸣，童谣曰：「白鼍鸣，龟背平，南郡城中可长生，守死不去义无成。」",
      "reading": "《江表傳》以公安鼉鳴與童謠為先兆，按所引書記傳聞。",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete"
    },
    {
